    `createComplex(Infinity, NaN)` (because `Infinity * 0.0` is `NaN`).
    This results in `NaN`.
    Mathematically, `Infinity / 1` should be `Infinity`. The current implementation incorrectly yields `NaN` for `Infinity / finite`.

